<title>ECUADOR: ECUADOR'S COFFEE EXPORT PRICES DETAILED.</title>
<headline>ECUADOR'S COFFEE EXPORT PRICES DETAILED.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the</p>
<p>minimum FOB reference prices for export of a 100-pound (45.36</p>
<p>kilo) sacks of ecuadorean coffee, effective from August 7 to</p>
<p>August 13 the 1997.</p>
<p>	 Washed arabic....................$ 182.62</p>
<p>	 Natural arabic...................$ 168.57</p>
<p>	 Robust natural...................$  62.03</p>
<p>	 Roasted and/or ground............$ 137.21</p>
</text>
